{"data": [{"author_id": "1001351444", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:46:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119245058608427268"], "id": "2119245058608427268", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 491, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨중국 인민은행, 24개월 연속 금 매집…2026년에만 129톤 추가 확보\n\n중국 중앙은행인 인민은행(PBOC)이 지난 10월 약 25.8톤(약 33억 달러)의 금을 추가 매입하며 24개월 연속 금 매집을 이어갔음. 11월 7일 발표된 공식 통계에 따르면 중국의 금 보유량은 총 7,830만 트로이온스(약 2,435톤)로 https://t.co/U8oPwRRoVV", "url": "https://x.com/64bitcoinkr/status/2119245058608427268"}, {"author_id": "1727439102654746624", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:17:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119237834850828656"], "id": "2119237834850828656", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC official told state-run Financial News authorities will investigate parties tied to Solana ads on Shanghai's Citigroup Tower and halted Accelerate China events.\n\nMy take: China says brand marketing counts as crypto promotion under its February rules. Who's next?", "url": "https://x.com/defimojis/status/2119237834850828656"}, {"author_id": "1931415459225845761", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:41:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119198480908591352"], "id": "2119198480908591352", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119194769545191702", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "因为我们没有金融牌照，没有支付系统，人民不能在我们的企业进行存款，不能直接购买商品，只能存放金币+免费兑换商品，如果人民不提取金币=大量资金在我们的APP里，人民提取金币自动兑换成人民币=一部分存款流入了微信+支付宝，我们的钱没有直接流入银行，人民只能通过微信或支付宝把钱提取到银行卡里 https://t.co/G4OP6SrJtf", "url": "https://x.com/louise88889/status/2119198480908591352"}, {"author_id": "2029678309928488961", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:05:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119234838305906770"], "id": "2119234838305906770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Fade KWEB at $24.88. The Nov. 10 tariff-exclusion deadline hits as the Fed signals more tightening. Buy gold at $4,074.90: PBOC buying and Hormuz disruption reinforce the hedge.", "url": "https://x.com/chinavol1/status/2119234838305906770"}, {"author_id": "1931415459225845761", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:52:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119186196878487867"], "id": "2119186196878487867", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119184637427601770", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我们知道人民的每个账号在一天之内跳出弹窗广告多少次，人民从弹窗广告跳转到旗舰店或(每天)消费多少，人民从广告跳转互联网企业去购物是否有付费？以及付费多少，我们不要求人民实名，也不要求绑定银行卡，只要求人民绑定微信=用于收款，可以换绑微信，根据规则，一人实名能注册5个微信号… https://t.co/Gv8FD6o2gJ", "url": "https://x.com/louise88889/status/2119186196878487867"}, {"author_id": "2029233769409024000", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:05:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119174394954002460"], "id": "2119174394954002460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Penang just cancelled 27,734 camera-issued parking fines.\nDrivers had 1 minute to pay. It did not hold up.\nLPR owners: give at least 10 minutes of grace, audit every flagged plate, and make appeals easy. https://t.co/ubmu8JSO4u", "url": "https://x.com/winsparking/status/2119174394954002460"}, {"author_id": "1931415459225845761", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:55:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119187054907085002"], "id": "2119187054907085002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 154, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119184637427601770", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我们投资的APP肯定会监督人民资金的流向和消费记录，防止人民利用AI